<template name="tallies"><view class="pp-tallies"><view wx:for="{{stats}}" wx:key="label" class="tally"><text class="tally-n">{{item.n}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text></view></view></template>
<template name="passport"><view class="pp"><view class="passport-share-trigger" bindtap="sharePassport"><view>生成我的米其林结算地图<text class="small">一张长图 · 足迹地图 · 到访清单 · 我的评分</text></view><text>↗</text></view><block wx:if="{{!opened}}"><view class="pp-cover-stage"><view class="pp-cover" bindtap="flip"><view class="pp-cover-border"/><view class="pp-cover-publisher">米其林全球名录<text class="small">PERSONAL COLLECTION</text></view><image class="pp-cover-emblem" src="/assets/passport-gold.png"/><view class="pp-cover-name">美食护照</view><view class="pp-cover-en">FOOD PASSPORT</view><view class="pp-cover-motto">A WORLD OF TASTE</view><view class="pp-cover-bottom"><image src="/assets/chip-gold.png"/><text>私人珍藏 · 每一餐都值得记住</text></view></view><view class="pp-cover-caption"><text>世界很大，值得一口一口去认识。</text><text>轻触封面，翻开护照 →</text></view></view><view class="pp-cover-summary"><template is="tallies" data="{{stats:stats}}"/></view></block><block wx:else><view class="pp-toolbar"><text>资料与签章 · 左右滑动翻页</text><text bindtap="flip">合上护照</text></view><view class="pp-spread-stage" style="height:{{bookHeight}}px" bindtouchstart="bookTouchStart" bindtouchend="bookTouchEnd"><view class="pp-book" style="transform:scale({{bookScale}})"><view class="pp-page pp-identity"><view class="pp-page-header"><text>FOOD PASSPORT / 资料页</text><text>01</text></view><view class="pp-identity-head"><view class="pp-portrait"><image src="/assets/passport.png"/></view><view><text class="pp-field-label">持有人 / HOLDER</text><view class="h4">美食旅行者</view><text class="pp-holder-en">THE FOOD EXPLORER</text><text class="pp-field-label pp-type">护照类型 / PERSONAL</text></view></view><view class="pp-intro">以一餐为起点，
收集与世界相遇的证据。</view><template is="tallies" data="{{stats:stats}}"/><view class="pp-document-row"><text>已收藏目的地 / WISHLIST</text><text>{{wantCount}} 家想去</text></view><view class="pp-ratings"><text wx:for="{{levelCounts}}" wx:key="name">{{item.name}} {{item.n}}</text><text wx:if="{{!levelCounts.length}}">尚未留下到访记录</text></view><view class="pp-dataset-note">星级以现有名单为准。</view><view class="pp-signature"><text>签名 / SIGNATURE</text><text class="signature">Bon appétit.</text></view><view class="pp-machine">P&lt;FOOD&lt;EXPLORER&lt;&lt;A&lt;WORLD&lt;OF&lt;TASTE
